{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgESuac5zTap3MhCNmFh5", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "**答案：** 在中世纪的西班牙，基督教王国在“收复失地运动”（Reconquista）中夺回摩尔人控制的领土后，最早在这些地方建立了委托监护制（encomienda）。圣地亚哥、卡拉特拉瓦、阿尔坎塔拉等军事骑士团把收复的土地、收入和居民交给骑士（comendador）管理，骑士则负责守卫边境、组织移民定居。后来，这种制度被搬到了美洲殖民地。\n\n这次搜了 1 次。\n\n**依据：**\n- [Wikipedia – Encomienda](https://Www.Wikipedia.org/wiki/Encomienda)\n- [Hispanopedia – Encomendero](https://es.hispanopedia.com/wiki/Encomendero)\n- [World History Encyclopedia – Encomienda](https://www.worldhistory.org/trans/es/1-20877/encomienda/)\n- [Revista de la Facultad de Derecho de México (UNAM)](https://journals.unam.mx/index.php/rfdm/article/download/85706/79044/279568)"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1518, "cache_read_input_tokens": 4287, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 1518}, "output_tokens": 3, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-21T00:37:25.989Z", "request_id": "req_011CgESuaMhkiPy4wzoPDkmy"}
